        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Los Alamos National Laboratory\n- Projects: FORTE, Manhattan Project\n- Places: Santa Fe, New Mexico\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- During World War II, Los Alamos National Laboratory was involved with the Manhattan Project.\n- Los Alamos National Laboratory is located a long distance northwest of Santa Fe, New Mexico.\n- Los Alamos National Laboratory co-developed and launched the Fast On-orbit Rapid Recording of Transient Events (FORTE).",
